+      <section anchor="response-headers" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-8.2">
+        <name slugifiedName="name-response-headers">Response Headers</name>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-8.2-1">The response-headers allow the request recipient to pass additional
+information about the response that cannot be placed in the Status-Line.  This header gives information about the server and about
+further access to the resource identified by the Request-URI.  All
+headers currently classified as response-headers are listed in
+Table 5.</t>
