+            <dd pn="section-22.14.3-1.12">RTSP 1.0 (RFC 2326).</dd>
+            <dt pn="section-22.14.3-1.13">Interoperability considerations:</dt>
+            <dd pn="section-22.14.3-1.14">The definition of the transport
+mechanism of RTSP over UDP has interoperability issues.  That
+makes the usage of this scheme problematic.</dd>
+            <dt pn="section-22.14.3-1.15">Security considerations:</dt>
+            <dd pn="section-22.14.3-1.16">All the security threats identified in
+Section 7 of RFC 3986 also apply to this scheme.  They need to
+be reviewed and considered in any implementation utilizing this
+scheme.</dd>
