-   RTSP due to HTTP clarifications:
-   *  Content-Encoding header can include encoding of type
-      &quot;identity&quot;.</li>
-        </ul>
-        <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-i.2-28">
-          <li pn="section-i.2-28.1"> The state machine section has been completely rewritten.  It now
-   includes more details and is also more clear about the model used.</li>
-        </ul>
-        <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-i.2-29">
-          <li pn="section-i.2-29.1"> An IANA section has been included that contains a number of
