-      time.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-i.2-33"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-   *  Strong recommendations why servers and clients should use
-      persistent connections have also been added.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-i.2-34"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-   *  There is now a requirement on the servers to handle non-
-      persistent connections as this provides fault tolerance.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-i.2-35"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-   *  Added wording on the usage of Connection:Close for RTSP.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-i.2-36"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-   *  Specified usage of TLS for RTSP messages, including a scheme to
-      approve a proxy's TLS connection to the next hop.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-i.2-37">
-          <li pn="section-i.2-37.1"> The following header-related changes have been made:</li>
-        </ul>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-i.2-38"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
